You have version 1.0.0.0 of a published Power Apps app. You create and publish version 2.0.0.0 of the app. A customer then restores the app’s earlier version.  

How many versions of the app appear on its **Version** tab?

<Dropdown
  blanks={[{"id":"versions","options":["1","2","3","4"],"answer":"3"}]}
  template={"You will see {{versions}} versions of the app."}
  templateMode={"prose"}
  explanation={"Restoring a previous Power Apps version does not replace or remove the existing version history; it creates a new version that contains the restored app state. The two published versions plus the version created by the restore result in three displayed versions.\
